### Cross-References

```rst
Cross-References
================

Link to another document: :doc:`installation`

Link to a section: :ref:`my-reference-label`

Link to Python objects:

* :py:func:`mymodule.myfunction`
* :py:class:`mymodule.MyClass`
* :py:meth:`mymodule.MyClass.method`
* :py:attr:`mymodule.MyClass.attribute`
* :py:mod:`mymodule`

External links: `Python <https://python.org>`_

.. _my-reference-label:

Section with Label
------------------

This section can be referenced using :ref:`my-reference-label`.
```

## Advanced Features

### Custom Extensions

```python
# _ext/custom_extension.py
from docutils import nodes
from docutils.parsers.rst import Directive
from sphinx.util.docutils import SphinxDirective

class TodoDirective(SphinxDirective):
    """Custom todo directive"""
    
    has_content = True
    required_arguments = 0
    optional_arguments = 1
    option_spec = {
        'class': str,
        'priority': str,
    }
    
    def run(self):
        # Parse content
        todo_node = nodes.admonition()
        todo_node['classes'].append('todo')
        
        # Add title
        title = self.arguments[0] if self.arguments else 'TODO'
        title_node = nodes.title(text=title)
        todo_node.append(title_node)
        
        # Add content
        self.state.nested_parse(self.content, self.content_offset, todo_node)
        
        # Add priority if specified
        if 'priority' in self.options:
            priority = self.options['priority']
            todo_node['classes'].append(f'priority-{priority}')
        
        return [todo_node]

def setup(app):
    app.add_directive('todo', TodoDirective)
    app.add_css_file('todo.css')
    
    return {
        'version': '0.1',
        'parallel_read_safe': True,
        'parallel_write_safe': True,
    }
```

### API Documentation Templates

```python
# _templates/autosummary/class.rst
{{ fullname | escape | underline}}

.. currentmodule:: {{ module }}

.. autoclass:: {{ objname }}
   :members:
   :show-inheritance:
   :inherited-members:
   :special-members: __init__, __str__, __repr__

   {% block methods %}
   .. rubric:: {{ _('Methods') }}

   .. autosummary::
      :nosignatures:
   {% for item in methods %}
      ~{{ name }}.{{ item }}
   {%- endfor %}
   {% endblock %}

   {% block attributes %}
   {% if attributes %}
   .. rubric:: {{ _('Attributes') }}

   .. autosummary::
   {% for item in attributes %}
      ~{{ name }}.{{ item }}
   {%- endfor %}
   {% endif %}
   {% endblock %}
```

